---
const shots = [
  {
    title: "Allocation-Treemap",
    src: "/screenshots/allocation-treemap.png",
    caption:
      "Sektor-, Regions- und Positionsgewichte auf einen Blick. Klick auf eine Kachel öffnet die Detailanalyse.",
  },
  {
    title: "TWRR Performance",
    src: "/screenshots/twrr-performance.png",
    caption:
      "Zeitgewichtete Rendite gegen Smart Benchmark — über mehrere Perioden parallel.",
  },
  {
    title: "Risiko-Panel",
    src: "/screenshots/risiko-panel.png",
    caption:
      "Volatilität, Sharpe, Max Drawdown und Beta. Pro Position und auf Portfolio-Ebene.",
  },
  {
    title: "Dividenden-Panel",
    src: "/screenshots/dividenden-panel.png",
    caption:
      "Forward-12-Monats-Prognose deiner Brutto-Dividenden — projiziert aus den letzten Ausschüttungen deiner Positionen, nicht aus einem Kalender.",
  },
];
---

<section class="section" id="screenshots">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">Screenshots</span>
    <h2>So sieht's aus.</h2>
    <p class="lead" style="margin-top: 1rem;">
      Vier Ansichten aus der laufenden Private Beta — Allokation, Performance,
      Risiko und die Dividenden-Prognose, an denen du dein Depot wirklich misst.
    </p>

    <div class="grid shots-grid" style="margin-top: 3rem;">
      {shots.map((s, i) => (
        <figure class={`shot${i === 0 ? " shot--feature" : ""}`}>
          <div class="shot__frame">
            <div class="shot__chrome" aria-hidden="true">
              <span></span><span></span><span></span>
            </div>
            <div class="shot__body">
              <div class="shot__placeholder" aria-hidden="true">
                <span class="shot__title-tag">{s.title}</span>
                <span class="shot__hint">Screenshot folgt</span>
              </div>
              <img
                class="shot__img"
                src={s.src}
                alt={s.title}
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
                onload="this.previousElementSibling.style.display='none'"
                onerror="this.remove()"
              />
            </div>
          </div>
          <figcaption class="shot__cap">
            <h3>{s.title}</h3>
            <p class="text-dim">{s.caption}</p>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .shots-grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  }

  .shot--feature {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .shots-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .shot {
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .shot__frame {
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 10;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--surface-2), var(--bg-elev));
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .shot__chrome {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    padding: 0.6rem 0.85rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--surface);
  }

  .shot__chrome span {
    width: 9px;
    height: 9px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--border-strong);
  }

  .shot__body {
    flex: 1;
    position: relative;
    background: var(--surface);
  }

  .shot__placeholder {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.025) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.025) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 24px 24px;
  }

  .shot__img {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: contain;
    object-position: center;
    display: block;
  }

  .shot__title-tag {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
    background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.25);
    padding: 0.3rem 0.7rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
  }

  .shot__hint {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-mute);
  }

  .shot__cap h3 {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .shot__cap p {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
  }
</style>
